{"sourceUrl":"https://www.fjmu.edu.cn/ggwsxy/2025/0612/c3016a206545/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:33.543139+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://www.fjmu.edu.cn/ggwsxy/2025/0612/c3016a206545/page.htm","html":"<div><p></p><p><span><span>为加强优秀学子对公共卫生相关领域的深入了解，为师生搭建沟通与交流平台，加强学术科研能力的培养，</span><span><span>我院</span></span><span>精心策划了本次夏令营活动。</span></span></p><p><span>福建医科大学公共卫生学院前身为福建医学院卫生系，始建于</span><span>1959</span><span><span>年，是我国早期开设预防医学本科专业的少数院系之一</span><span><span>，</span></span></span><span>2001</span><span>年在原预防医学系基础上成立公共卫生学院。现有公共卫生与预防医学一级学科博士、硕士学位授权点、公共卫生硕士（</span><span>MPH</span><span><span>）专业学位授权点。</span><span><span>近</span></span><span>年来，公共卫生与预防医学学科排名稳步提升，</span></span><span>2024</span><span>软科中国最好学科排名位列第</span><span>31</span><span>位；最好专业排名，预防医学专业位列第</span><span>27</span><span>名，卫生检验与检疫专业位列第</span><span>8</span><span>名。我院公共卫生与预防医学进入校友会</span><span>2023</span><span>中国大学一流学科排名第</span><span>15</span><span>名（前</span><span>20%</span><span><span>）。</span><span><span>拥有</span></span><span><span>公共卫生与预防医学博士后科研流动站、</span></span><span>公共卫生与预防医学福建省一流（高原）学科</span><span><span>，</span></span><span>国家级预防医学特色专业建设点、公共卫生与预防医学国家级实验教学示范中心，预防医学专业入选国家级一流本科专业建设点；</span><span><span>拥有</span></span><span>流行病与卫生统计学、环境与健康、公共卫生与预防医学、营养与食品安全等</span></span><span>4</span><span>个省级重点学科；拥有林东昕院士联合实验室、“环境因素与肿瘤”省重点实验室、“环境与健康”省高校重点实验室、重大慢性非传染性疾病精准防控研究协同创新中心、国家健康医疗大数据（福州）研究院、数字福建肿瘤大数据研究所、福建队列中心等</span><span>7</span><span>个省级重点实验室、技术平台和现场。</span></p><p><span><span><strong>一、活动组织</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span><span>举办单位：福建医科大学公共卫生学院</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>二、时间安排</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>报名时间：</span></span></span><span><span><span>2024</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日—</span></span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>30</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>活动时间：</span></span></span><span><span><span>2024</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>8</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日—</span></span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>三、参加对象</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span><span>校外学生：全国高等医学院校和综合大学公共卫生与预防医学相关专业的</span></span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span><span>届本科毕业生</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span><span>本校学生：</span></span></span><span><span><span>2021</span></span></span><span><span><span>级、</span></span></span><span><span><span>2022</span></span></span><span><span><span>级预防医学专业本科生，</span></span></span><span><span><span>2022</span></span></span><span><span><span>级、</span></span></span><span><span><span>2023</span></span></span><span><span><span>级卫生检验与检疫专业本科生，本校其他专业感兴趣学生</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>四、举办形式</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>本校学生：现场参加</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>校外学生：现场参加或在线参加</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>欢迎校外学生现场参加。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>五、举办地点</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>现场：福建医科大学旗山校区公共卫生学院</span></span></span><span><span><span>319</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>学术报告厅</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>线上：腾讯会议（会议号后期通知）</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>六、</strong></span></span><span><strong>活动安排</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span>1.7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>日上午：报到、参观校园</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>日下午：学院介绍、学术讲座</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span><span>日：</span></span><span>课题交流、课题组介绍</span></span></p><p><span><span>具体</span><span><span>日程</span></span><span>安排将另行通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>七、</strong></span></span><span><strong>申请条件</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>1</span></span><span>.</span></span></span><span><span>具有良好的思想品德</span><span><span>，</span></span><span>身心健康；</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>2</span></span><span>.</span></span></span><span>在学期间成绩优秀，总成绩专业排名前</span><span>20%</span><span><span>，英语水平良好，通过全国大学英语</span><span><span>四</span></span><span>级考试。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>八、</strong></span></span><span><strong>申请流程</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span>本院学生由学院统一组织；非本院本科生需报名参加。具体流程为：</span></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span><span>营员</span></span><span>报名：</span><span><span>填写申请表，并</span></span><a href=\"mailto:将个人简历及相关证明材料发送至gwjkb@fjmu.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>提供个人简历、身份证、学生证、</span><span><span>在学期间</span></span><span>成绩单、全国大学英语</span><span><span>四</span></span><span>级成绩单、其他获奖证书、发表论文首页或证明等相关材料</span><span><span>发送</span></span></a><span><span>邮箱（</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>E</span></span><span>mail:</span><span><span>2917367118@qq.com</span></span></span></span><span><span>）。</span></span></p><p><span>2.</span><span><span>资格审核：我院将根据报名情况和择优原则，确定入选营员名单。通过审核</span><span><span>者</span></span><span><span>可参加，</span></span><span>请保持通讯设备畅通。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>九、</strong></span></span><span><strong>注意事项</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>请认真、严谨提供个人资料，若发现弄虚作假，取消入营资格</span><span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>请在规定时间内报名，逾期者不予受理。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>3</span></span><span>.</span></span></span><span>参加暑期夏令营的学生必须遵守福建医科大学的相关规定，按照统一的安排参加各项活动。</span></p><p><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span>所有学生食宿、差旅费自理。</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.</span></span><span><span>全程参加活动者，颁发结营证书。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>十、</strong></span></span><span><strong>联系方式</strong></span><span><span><strong>：</strong></span></span></span></p><p><span>联系电话：</span><span>0591-22862023</span></p><p><span><span>QQ</span></span><span><span>群：</span></span><span><span>590924114</span></span></p><p><span>联系人：杨老师</span></p><p><span><span><span><span>E</span></span><span>mail:</span><span><span>2917367118@qq.com</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>本通知自公布之日起实施，未列事项参考学校相关规定执行，</span><span><span>并</span></span><span>由公共卫生学院负责解释。 </span></span></p><p><span>欢迎广大师生参加！</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://www.fjmu.edu.cn/ggwsxy/2025/0612/c3016a206545/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span>附件：</span></span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://www.fjmu.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://www.fjmu.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/42/e2/f37f688d40e385311fe0a9efb937/0b086199-fb06-42a4-8d48-244473b6a4ae.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>福建医科大学公共卫生学院2025年暑期夏令营申请表.doc</span></a><span><span>             </span></span></p><p><span></span></p><p><br/><br/></p><p><span><span>福建医科大学公共卫生学院</span></span></p><p><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p><p><br/></p></div